ArchiveEntry "SMIB conservative: D=0 energy conserved"

/*
 * Undamped pendulum (D=0): H is exactly conserved (Hdot=0).
 * Marginal stability (closed orbits), no asymptotic stability.
 */
ProgramVariables Real delta; Real w; Real s; Real c; Real h0; End.
Problem
  \forall K (
    K > 0 & s^2+c^2=1 & h0 = w^2+2*K*(1-c)
    ->
    [{delta'=w, w'=-K*s, s'=c*w, c'=-s*w & s^2+c^2=1}]
    w^2+2*K*(1-c) = h0 )
End.
Tactic "Proof" allR(1); implyR(1); dI(1) End.
End.
